sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Wallet
    participant R as Relay
    participant P as Provider
    participant B as Bitcoin
    participant L as Lightning
    W->>R: read 39600 profiles + 39601 offerings
    W->>R: RFQ 39604 (gift-wrapped)
    R->>P: opaque wrap
    P->>R: Quote 39605 (signed, pinned terms)
    R->>W: quote wrap
    W->>R: Order 39606 (commits quote id)
    R->>P: order wrap
    P->>L: hold invoice
    Note over W: verify before fund:<br/>script, amounts, hash, timelocks
    W->>B: fund lockup
    P->>B: watch confirmations
    P->>R: Status 39607 seq 0..n
    P->>L: pay invoice
    L->>W: preimage
    W->>B: claim with preimage
    W->>R: Close 39609
    P->>R: Close 39609
    R->>R: redacted public receipt 39603
